+# Perf history
+
+## UserPromptSubmit read path
+
+Benchmark: adversarial synthetic vocabulary, Zipf-distributed, 30 frequent domain
+words plus 2 000 rare identifiers (`word()` in `crates/muninn-bench/src/main.rs`).
+Metric: `hook UserPromptSubmit full p95`.
+
+- **Before fix: p95 = 10.27 ms.** Common terms (df close to n) produced long
+  posting lists during IDF top-8 term selection.
+- **Fix:** drop terms with `df > n/3` from term selection before scoring
+  (`crates/muninn-core/src/recall.rs`, IDF top-8 term selection step) — a term
+  that appears in more than a third of the store carries no signal and only
+  costs a long posting list.
+- **After fix: p95 = 1.82 ms.**
+
+Source of the two numbers: recorded in this project's own session transcript
+(2026-09-13, trust level 1 — observed tool output, not re-derived here). No
+run log or results file in the repo currently carries these two raw figures;
+if exact reproduction is needed, rerun `muninn-bench perf` against the same
+synthetic vocab.
